    "scenesThatPass": [
      "STEFFIE: Space?\nJACK DENISE: Our station wagon. It’s called the sun’s corolla. We saw it the other night on the weather network.\nSTEFFIE: I thought Corolla was a car.",
      "BABETTE: This isn’t the lunch I planned for myself. I was thinking yogurt and wheat germ.\nDENISE: Where have we heard that before?",
      "DENISE: You keep buying stuff that you never eat!\nSTEFFIE: Because Babette thinks if she keeps buying it, she’ll have to eat it just to get rid of it.\nDENISE: But then we end up throwing it out.",
      "DENISE: What’s that beeping?\nBABETTE STEFFIE: It’s the smoke alarm. Is there a fire?",
      "STEFFIE: It’s like love slash hate.\nBABETTE: I’m going to take a shower and then we’ll go to the mall.\nDENISE: Didn’t she already shower today?\nDENISE: Dylar."
    ]
